#: ../../source/module/training-audit-data-map.md:1
#: c88a4423898d4a8dbdf1f2d2cca1da9f
msgid "数据地图：组分、结构相与磁类型"
msgstr "Data map: composition, phases, and magnetic types"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:1156
#: 0b74461f1a8d4f819afb858f178592b2
msgid ""
"「组分地图」按精确原子比例合并结构。例如，`Fe2Ni2`、`Fe4Ni4` 和 `Fe32Ni32` 都归入同一个 `Fe:Ni = 1:1` "
"组分点。右侧表格仍保留结构数量、原子数和 `Config_type`，不会把不同尺寸的结构当成同一个结构。"
msgstr ""
"The Composition Map merges structures by exact atomic ratio. For example,"
" `Fe2Ni2`, `Fe4Ni4`, and `Fe32Ni32` belong to the same `Fe:Ni = 1:1` "
"composition point. The table on the right still keeps the structure "
"count, atom count, and `Config_type`, so different sizes are not treated "
"as the same structure."

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:1158
#: f8a2707b768b4bbbb1684228aa4979d1
msgid ""
"第一次进入时，柱高表示该浓度下的结构数。基础诊断显示后，页面默认自动在后台遍历当前评估范围内的所有结构；不需要另找按钮启动。大体系如果不希望自动分析，可在「设置"
" → 个性化」中关闭「自动分析结构证据」。分析完成后会增加两种视图，但不会擅自切换当前组分图："
msgstr ""
"On first entry, bar height shows the number of structures at each "
"composition. After the basic diagnostics appear, the page automatically "
"scans every structure in the current audit scope in the background; there"
" is no separate start button. For large systems, disable `Analyze "
"structure evidence automatically` under `Settings → Personalization` if "
"automatic analysis is undesirable. Completion adds two more views without"
" switching away from the current composition map:"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:1160
#: 63bebcece2d349a6a4cb0997275c45c3
msgid ""
"**结构相：** FCC、HCP、BCC，以及通过保守模板确认的 "
"A4、L1₀、L1₂、B1、B2、B3、B4、C1、B8₁、D0₃、L2₁、C1ᵦ、D0₁₉、C14、C15；其余显示为混合局域结构或未解析；"
msgstr ""
"**Structural phase:** FCC, HCP, BCC, plus A4, L1₀, L1₂, B1, B2, B3, B4, "
"C1, B8₁, D0₃, L2₁, C1ᵦ, D0₁₉, C14, and C15 when confirmed by conservative"
" templates; all other cases are shown as mixed local structure or "
"unresolved;"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:1161
#: 25311895851846a5abac0dca3775b00f
msgid ""
"**磁类型：** FM、AFM（未细分）、逐层 AFM（`↑↓`）、双层 AFM（`↑↑↓↓`）、FiM、PM-"
"like（自旋无序）、其他非共线、未识别、低／零磁矩和无有效 `spin` 字段。"
msgstr ""
"**Magnetic type:** FM, AFM (not further classified), layer-by-layer AFM "
"(`↑↓`), double-layer AFM (`↑↑↓↓`), FiM, PM-like (spin-disordered), other "
"noncollinear, unrecognized, low/zero moment, and no valid `spin` field."

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:1163
#: 5b4eff9eb02448a3b5a3980ce3b37b7e
#
msgid "分析结束后，可以先选组分，再用结构相和磁类型下拉框继续筛选。点击「查看选中的结构」即可回到 `NEP 数据集查看`。"
msgstr ""
"After analysis, select a composition first, then refine the selection "
"with the structural-phase and magnetic-type lists. Click `View selected "
"structures` to return to `NEP Dataset Display`."

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:1165
#: 9ccd93edb4af44da8348ab8349b52202
msgid ""
"相和磁是两条独立证据。同一个 FCC 或 BCC 骨架可以承载不同磁结构，所以页面不会把它们合成一个不可拆分的标签。`Config_type` "
"只是来源元数据，不参与结构相或磁类型判断。"
msgstr ""
"Phase and magnetism are independent evidence channels. The same FCC or "
"BCC framework can support different magnetic structures, so the page does"
" not merge them into one inseparable label. `Config_type` is source "
"metadata only and does not participate in structural-phase or magnetic-"
"type identification."

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:1167
#: 5a0da89c552b42f7b8777610daabe575
msgid ""
"在「进阶证据 → 磁序」中还可以切换三张按结构帧数归一化的 100% "
"堆叠图：每个结构相中的磁类型占比、每个磁类型中的结构相占比，以及整个评估范围的磁类型占比。颜色段中的百分比和右侧帧数分别回答“占多少”和“有多少帧”；点击任一颜色段可回选对应结构。"
msgstr ""
"Under `Advanced Evidence → Magnetic Order`, three 100% stacked charts "
"normalized by structure-frame count are available: magnetic-type shares "
"within each structural phase, structural-phase shares within each "
"magnetic type, and magnetic-type shares across the full audit scope. "
"Percentages inside colored segments show the share, while frame counts on"
" the right show the absolute number of frames. Click any segment to "
"select its structures."

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:1169
#: fb51f93103f94e4b87ffd682b993a873
msgid "训练集评估的磁类型占比视图，显示图表切换、结构帧占比、颜色图例和结构回选入口"
msgstr ""
"Training Set Audit magnetic-type share view, showing chart switching, "
"structure-frame shares, the color legend, and structure-selection entry "
"point"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:1169
#: fb51f93103f94e4b87ffd682b993a873
msgid ""
".. image:: "
"../_static/image/generated/training_set_audit_magnetic_shares.png"
msgstr ""
".. image:: "
"../_static/image/generated/training_set_audit_magnetic_shares.png"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:1174
#: bac0e29eb2c94e4397972860fdc38619
msgid "训练集评估的组分地图，标出证据层切换、相分布柱图、精确组分表和结构回选控件"
msgstr ""
"Training Set Audit composition map, highlighting evidence-layer "
"switching, the phase-distribution bars, exact-composition table, and "
"structure-selection controls"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:1174
#: bac0e29eb2c94e4397972860fdc38619
msgid ".. image:: ../_static/image/generated/training_set_audit_structure_map.png"
msgstr ".. image:: ../_static/image/generated/training_set_audit_structure_map.png"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:1179
#: 383f8d5224ff46ec97ff40f3d7527436
msgid ""
"上图使用的示例数据只有一个 `Pb:Te = 1:1` 精确组分点，而且 a-CNA "
"和内置原型模板都没有给出强证据，因此柱子显示为灰色「未解析」。这不是程序出错，而是「当前几何证据不足以给出已支持标签」。如果数据带有有效 "
"`spin:R:3`，右上角证据层还会出现「按磁序着色」，下方磁序筛选框也会启用。"
msgstr ""
"The example above has only one exact composition point, `Pb:Te = 1:1`, "
"and neither a-CNA nor the built-in prototype templates provide strong "
"evidence. The bar is therefore gray and labeled `Unresolved`. This is not"
" an application error; it means the current geometric evidence is "
"insufficient for a supported label. If the data contain a valid "
"`spin:R:3` field, `Color by magnetic order` also appears in the evidence-"
"layer selector and the magnetic-order filter below is enabled."
